    "title": "Northview 8, Clay City 1 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Grant Pugh ,\n1 hours ago\nCLAY CITY, Ind. (WTWO/WAWV) — Northview wins at Clay City, 8-1 Wednesday night in high school softball as the Knights push their winning streak to five games.\nMaggie Krause and Mackie Pell each homered for the Knights in the victory.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to MyWabashValley.com.",
